{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/914600-stupid-awesome-pimp-my-hoss","id":914600,"title":"[Stupid Awesome] Pimp My Hoss","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-14T20:10:56-07:00","id":914600,"title":"[Stupid Awesome] Pimp My Hoss","content":"So, it has come to my attention that CoD core slipped in rules for vehicular modification, as well as Style merits for dangerous driving.<br /> <br /> It has also come to my attention that horses are on the vehicle list. By an awesome reading of the rules, <i>you can do all this stuff while on a horse.</i><br /> <br /> Let's see:<br /> <br /> <b>Modifying Vehicles:</b> Anyone can modify vehicles - takes 4 hours per modification, and you can apply up to twice your Crafts of them to your horse.<br /> <b>Automotive Genius:</b> However, any <i>real</i> transequinist is going to have this Merit - it raises the limit to thrice your Crafts dots, and you can get extra modifications for stuff like a Crafts speciality in &quot;Horses&quot;.<br /> <b>Crack Driver:</b> You drive that horse <i>so damn well</i>. It ain't getting into any accidents.<br /> <b>Stunt Driver:</b> You know who can weave a horse in full gallop through hairpin turns, and can let her horse <i>dodge bullets</i>? You. This is your horse on <i>amazing</i>.<br /> <br /> One of the <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/15PLeCG-9xqTTaz66JQgLTQHE8OE6-pqsG-6NDddKzok/edit#heading=h.a5xny3xiyu6p\" target=\"_blank\">Hurt Locker spoiler docs</a> gives us a few more sweet, sweet driving merits. To apply to horses.<br /> <br /> <b>Aggresive Driving:</b> OK, you take this mechanically so you can chase people easier. But really you're taking this so you can do sweet powerslides <i>on your horse</i>.<br /> <b>One-Handed Driving:</b> Now you're doing those sweet powerslides or whatever while doing something else. Like writing your memoirs. Or doing handstands on the horse.<br /> <b>Roadkill:</b> SCREW YOU, ANYONE WHO I RUN OVER WITH MY HORSE! Unfortunately, it is written using MPH, not Speed like the core book, so some conversions are necessary (probably just double the damage to the other guy from Speed - it seems more or less equivalent.)<br /> <br /> <br /> Oh, alright, we'll look at the one merit you're <i>supposed</i> to use on horseback.<br /> <br /> <b>Mounted Combat</b> is interesting, since we can use the vehicle modification rules to improve the horse's Speed by <i>a lot</i>. Too bad the rules are somewhat contradictory~!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-14T20:13:37-07:00","id":914602,"title":"","content":"Because I'm... crazy..., I just want to go on record that someone with Craft 5, Automotive Genius, and Craft (Horses) could deliver you a Size 16 horse.<br /> <br /> Yes, by the chart that <i>is</i> larger than an elephant.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{